<title>BELGIUM: TERCA, MOSANE DIRECTORS JOIN BNB.</title>
<headline>TERCA, MOSANE DIRECTORS JOIN BNB.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Christian Dumolin, chairman of Belgian building products group Koramic, and Dominique Collinet, chairman of holding company Mosane were on Monday elected to the Belgian National Bank's Council of Regency and Board of Censors, respectively.</p>
<p>Dumolin replaces Rik Van Aerschot. Collinet replaces Rogier Mene.</p>
<p>The Council of Regency meets once a week and is responsible for setting the bank's interest rates. The Board of Censors meets at least once a month to examine the bank's books.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
